WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.800
- [Narrator] This is black ramen.

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:04.640
And this dish in particular

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.840
is a five-time national champion.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.890
But its origins came from a restaurant

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:11.610
a few paces down the road.

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:12.920
Here.

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:15.837
(foreign language)

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:32.580
Toyama is a coastal city
in the northeast of Japan.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.180
It is known worldwide for
one thing in particular.

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:39.491
And that is its signature
Toyama black ramen.

00:00:39.491 --> 00:00:42.408
(foreign language)

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.058
The recipe originated
back in 1947 from one man.

00:00:53.058 --> 00:00:56.273
(foreign language)

00:00:56.273 --> 00:01:00.050
Traditionally, ramen broth
is made from pork or miso.

00:01:00.050 --> 00:01:02.810
When these were not available, Mr. Aoiki

00:01:02.810 --> 00:01:06.046
looked to what was around,
and that was soy sauce.

00:01:06.046 --> 00:01:08.963
(foreign language)

00:01:41.675 --> 00:01:44.120
If you want to try Toyama black ramen,

00:01:44.120 --> 00:01:46.809
you have to go to Toyama.

00:01:46.809 --> 00:01:49.726
(foreign language)

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.870
And one of those is Ramen Iroha,

00:01:53.870 --> 00:01:56.150
whose black ramen, as we said earlier,

00:01:56.150 --> 00:01:59.374
is often heralded as the
best ramen in the country.

00:01:59.374 --> 00:02:02.291
(foreign language)

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.060
This signature dish of the region

00:02:34.060 --> 00:02:37.820
draws in crowds from around
the country and the world.

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:39.760
And the claim of best ramen in Japan

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:42.403
makes the draw that much more intense.

00:02:42.403 --> 00:02:45.320
(foreign language)

00:02:56.890 --> 00:02:59.473
(upbeat music)

